  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>The Reppe and Destel gorges meet north of Ollioules to form the Ollioules gorges. The Provence Méditerranée tourist office presents them as a listed natural site with free access, open every day year-round.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p><strong>Dogs:</strong> the Provence Méditerranée tourist office says "animals accepted" and describes a sporty, difficult trail with a steep elevation change. It publishes no leash rule; on a trail described as difficult with a steep elevation change, a short leash is the safest option.</p>
      <p><strong>Route:</strong> the office calls the trail sporty, difficult and steep. It publishes no length, duration or precise starting point for it; the trail joins the GR 51. Ask a tourist office before setting out and bring hiking shoes.</p>
      <p><strong>Water and heat:</strong> the office publishes nothing about water in the canyon; don't count on finding water on site to cool your dog, and bring what you need.</p>
      <p><strong>Forest massifs:</strong> per the tourist office, they are closed to vehicles from 15 June to 15 September (possibly extended to 30 September) and access can be banned to walkers in case of very severe or extreme fire risk; the Var prefecture publishes the massif status every day before 7pm for the next day.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: a real good find if you're based in Toulon, outside summer and with a dog comfortable on rough terrain.</div>
      <p><strong>Worth checking before you go:</strong> massif status in summer, the trail's starting point, whether the canyon holds water, and the lack of a published leash rule for the site.</p>
      <h2>Sources</h2>
      <p>Source read on 20/11/2026: <a href="https://www.provencemed.com/activite/gorges-dollioules-et-le-destel">Provence Méditerranée tourist office</a>.</p>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The village of Ollioules, south of the gorges, is a possible stop before or after the outing.</p>
